flock LOCK_EX held, another process asks LOCK_TEX = refused
flock LOCK_EX held, another process asks LOCK_TSH = refused
flock after LOCK_UN, another process asks LOCK_TEX = granted
flock LOCK_SH held, another process asks LOCK_TSH = granted
flock LOCK_SH held, another process asks LOCK_TEX = refused
int_of_fd the descriptor's number = true
getpwents non-empty, and includes the current uid = true
